### Login (set token manually after response)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"admin","password":"admin"}

### Tenants
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/system/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dict types
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/system/dicts/types
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Configs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/system/configs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Online users
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/system/online-users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Login logs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/system/login-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Operation logs
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/system/operation-logs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
